# SQL Layoffs Data Cleaning & EDA

Data cleaning and exploratory data analysis (EDA) on a layoffs dataset using **MySQL**.  
Includes duplicate removal, data standardization, NULL handling, and SQL-based analysis.

## Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)

The EDA was performed using SQL to analyze layoffs trends by:
- company
- industry
- country
- year and month
- funding stage

The analysis includes aggregation, time-based trends, and ranking of companies by layoffs.
